/Images

# Guards: copyrighted readings stay on Dropbox; participant spreadsheets never
# belong on the public site.
readings/
*.xlsx

# Intro deck: 23 headshots (6 teaching staff, 17 participants), two logos,
# a 71 MB rendered PDF, and a .Rmd that names every participant
/slides/0 - Intro/
